{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And He said, Here I am.</b> The Holy One, blessed be He, said: You answered 'Here I am,' just as Abraham your forefather did. And it is written: ״במקום גדולים אל תעמוד״. The Holy One, blessed be He, said to him: ״אל תקרב הלום״ — not to the priesthood, of which ״קרב אל המזבח״ is written, and not to the kingship, of which ״הלום״ is written regarding David."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:02:32.813327726Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}